      <![CDATA[<p>欢迎来到新博客！本文用于一次性验证全部渲染链路：代码高亮、数学公式、三种图片来源与灯箱查看。</p><h2 id="代码块"><a href="#代码块" class="headerlink" title="代码块"></a>代码块</h2><pre class="line-numbers language-python" data-language="python"><code class="language-python"><span class="token keyword">def</span> <span class="token function">egcd</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>a<span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token builtin">int</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> b<span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token builtin">int</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>    <span class="token keyword">if</span> b <span class="token operator">==</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>        <span class="token keyword">return</span> a<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">0</span>    g<span class="token punctuation">,</span> x<span class="token punctuation">,</span> y <span class="token operator">=</span> egcd<span class="token punctuation">(</span>b<span class="token punctuation">,</span> a <span class="token operator">%</span> b<span class="token punctuation">)</span>    <span class="token keyword">return</span> g<span class="token punctuation">,</span> y<span class="token punctuation">,</span> x <span class="token operator">-</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>a <span class="token operator">//</span> b<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">*</span> y<span class="token keyword">print</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>egcd<span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token number">240</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">46</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h2 id="数学公式"><a href="#数学公式" class="headerlink" title="数学公式"></a>数学公式</h2><p>行内公式 $e &#x3D; \sum_{i&#x3D;0}^{n} a_i p^i$，以及块级公式：</p><p>$$<br>\varphi(n) &#x3D; (p-1)(q-1), \quad d \equiv e^{-1} \pmod{\varphi(n)}<br>$$</p><h2 id="图片来源一：Markdown-外链图床"><a href="#图片来源一：Markdown-外链图床" class="headerlink" title="图片来源一：Markdown 外链图床"></a>图片来源一：Markdown 外链图床</h2><p><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/fishfish-blog/800/450" alt="外链图床示例"></p><h2 id="图片来源二：在线编辑粘贴上传（-images-媒体库）"><a href="#图片来源二：在线编辑粘贴上传（-images-媒体库）" class="headerlink" title="图片来源二：在线编辑粘贴上传（&#x2F;images&#x2F; 媒体库）"></a>图片来源二：在线编辑粘贴上传（&#x2F;images&#x2F; 媒体库）</h2><p><img src="/images/sample-upload.svg" alt="本地上传示例"></p><h2 id="图片来源三：文章资源文件夹（相对路径）"><a href="#图片来源三：文章资源文件夹（相对路径）" class="headerlink" title="图片来源三：文章资源文件夹（相对路径）"></a>图片来源三：文章资源文件夹（相对路径）</h2><p><img src="/2026/11/04/hello-world/asset-sample.svg" alt="资源文件夹示例"></p><blockquote><p>以上任意图片点击均可灯箱放大查看。</p></blockquote>]]>
